{
    "title": "FanX Salt Lake 2024",
    "description": "The FanX Salt Lake Pop Culture and Comic Convention app is your road map to all things FanX! Download the app prior to the event for updates on guests, the event, tickets, Photo Ops, and easy access to our FAQ. Have your schedule ready by adding panels and Photo Ops to your app when times are announced. The app will help guide you during the show by giving you information about Panels, Photo Ops, Tickets, Celebrity Row, Vendor Floor, and more. We can't wait to celebrate pop culture and comics with you on September 26-28, 2024 at the Salt Palace Convention Center.",
